group_headers.text:
Surah 67–89 (Mulk → Fajr)
This group repeatedly reminds mankind of death, resurrection, judgment, and the fate of past nations. The message becomes more direct and intense, calling the human being to reflect on his end and prepare for meeting Allah.
Logic:
Remembering the Hereafter purifies the heart.
